{"seq":2,"slug":"validation-strategies","title":"校验策略与错误处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/validation-strategies","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"校验策略与错误处理\">校验策略与错误处理</h1><p>校验是表单的守门人——它决定何时拦截无效数据、以什么方式告知用户、以及如何在客户端校验与服务端校验之间建立一致性契约。选错校验时机会在&quot;反应迟钝&quot;与&quot;过度唠叨&quot;之间失衡；选错错误呈现方式则直接摧毁转化率。本文将校验问题分解为时机、规则、反馈三层，逐层给出工程方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>校验问题可沿三个正交维度分解：<strong>时机</strong>（<code>onSubmit</code>/<code>onBlur</code>/<code>onChange</code> 的连续频谱，决定反馈延迟与渲染代价）、<strong>规则</strong>（同步/异步、单字段/跨字段、客户端/服务端，决定校验层的组织架构）、<strong>反馈</strong>（错误消息的层级、服务端错误的回映射、Inline + Summary 组合呈现，决定用户能否高效修正）。三层的组合目标是一致的：既不&quot;过度唠叨&quot;，也不&quot;反应迟钝&quot;，同时保证服务端校验永远是不可绕过的最终层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验时机的频谱\">校验时机的频谱</h2><p>校验触发时机构成一个从&quot;最晚反馈&quot;到&quot;最早反馈&quot;的连续频谱：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>用户感知延迟</th>\n<th>渲染代价</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>onSubmit</code></td>\n<td>点击提交按钮</td>\n<td>最高（整表填完才知道错）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>简单登录表单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onBlur</code></td>\n<td>字段失去焦点</td>\n<td>中等（离开字段时反馈）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>注册表单、信用卡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onChange</code></td>\n<td>每次值变化</td>\n<td>最低（实时反馈）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>搜索过滤、密码强度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>onTouched</code></td>\n<td>首次 blur 后切到 onChange</td>\n<td>渐进式</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>React Hook Form 默认推荐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最佳实践不是选择单一时机，而是<strong>组合使用</strong>——React Hook Form 的 <code>mode: &#39;onTouched&#39;</code> 就是这种组合的具体实现：首次聚焦前不校验，首次 blur 触发校验，之后每次 change 都重新校验。这符合用户心理模型：&quot;我还没填完你别催我，但我填完离开了你要立刻告诉我对不对&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Pristine&#10;    Pristine --&gt; Validating: onBlur(首次触碰)&#10;    Validating --&gt; Valid: 校验通过&#10;    Validating --&gt; Invalid: 校验失败&#10;    Invalid --&gt; Validating: onChange(实时重校验)&#10;    Valid --&gt; Validating: onChange(值变化)&#10;    Valid --&gt; [*]: onSubmit&#10;    Invalid --&gt; Validating: onBlur(再次尝试)\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Pristine\n    Pristine --&gt; Validating: onBlur(首次触碰)\n    Validating --&gt; Valid: 校验通过\n    Validating --&gt; Invalid: 校验失败\n    Invalid --&gt; Validating: onChange(实时重校验)\n    Valid --&gt; Validating: onChange(值变化)\n    Valid --&gt; [*]: onSubmit\n    Invalid --&gt; Validating: onBlur(再次尝试)</pre><h2 id=\"同步校验与异步校验\">同步校验与异步校验</h2><h3 id=\"同步校验\">同步校验</h3><p>同步校验在当前事件循环内完成，适用于格式检查、必填检查、长度范围等纯计算型规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const validators = {&#10;  email: (value: string) =&gt; {&#10;    if (!value) return &#39;邮箱为必填项&#39;;&#10;    if (!/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/.test(value)) return &#39;邮箱格式无效&#39;;&#10;    return undefined;&#10;  },&#10;  password: (value: string) =&gt; {&#10;    if (value.length &lt; 8) return &#39;密码长度至少 8 位&#39;;&#10;    if (!/[A-Z]/.test(value)) return &#39;需要至少一个大写字母&#39;;&#10;    if (!/\\d/.test(value)) return &#39;需要至少一个数字&#39;;&#10;    return undefined;&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> validators</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '邮箱为必填项'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s@]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">@</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s@]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#85E89D;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">\\.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\s@]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+$</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '邮箱格式无效'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  password</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (value.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '密码长度至少 8 位'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[A-Z]</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '需要至少一个大写字母'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '需要至少一个数字'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"异步校验\">异步校验</h3><p>异步校验涉及网络请求（用户名唯一性检查、地址验证），需要处理三个额外问题：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>防抖（Debounce）：</strong> 避免每次击键都发请求。典型延迟 300–500ms。</li>\n<li><strong>竞态取消：</strong> 用户继续输入时取消上一次未完成的请求。AbortController 是标准方案。</li>\n<li><strong>加载态指示：</strong> 用户需要知道&quot;系统正在检查&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function validateUsername(value: string, signal: AbortSignal): Promise&lt;string | undefined&gt; {&#10;  const response = await fetch(`/api/check-username?q=${value}`, { signal });&#10;  const { available } = await response.json();&#10;  return available ? undefined : &#39;该用户名已被注册&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateUsername</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">signal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AbortSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`/api/check-username?q=${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">value</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { signal });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">available</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> undefined</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '该用户名已被注册'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>异步校验的结果缓存也很关键——如果用户输入 &quot;alice&quot;、删除改为 &quot;bob&quot;、再改回 &quot;alice&quot;，第二次 &quot;alice&quot; 应该命中缓存而非重新请求。用 <code>Map&lt;string, string | undefined&gt;</code> 做简单的 LRU 缓存即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨字段校验\">跨字段校验</h2><p>当校验规则涉及多个字段的关系时（确认密码 = 密码、结束日期 &gt; 开始日期），单字段校验器无法独立完成。三种实现模式：</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式一-refinement-zod-yup\">模式一：Refinement（Zod / Yup）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const schema = z&#10;  .object({&#10;    password: z.string().min(8),&#10;    confirmPassword: z.string(),&#10;  })&#10;  .refine((data) =&gt; data.password === data.confirmPassword, { error: &#39;两次密码不一致&#39;, path: [&#39;confirmPassword&#39;] });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> schema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    password: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    confirmPassword: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">refine</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.password </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data.confirmPassword, { error: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'两次密码不一致'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, path: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'confirmPassword'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] });</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>path</code> 参数将错误定位到具体字段，而非悬浮在表单级别。这对错误定位和无障碍（<code>aria-describedby</code> 关联）至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"模式二-form-level-validator\">模式二：Form-level Validator</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function validateForm(values: FormValues): Partial&lt;Record&lt;keyof FormValues, string&gt;&gt; {&#10;  const errors: Partial&lt;Record&lt;keyof FormValues, string&gt;&gt; = {};&#10;  if (values.endDate &lt;= values.startDate) {&#10;    errors.endDate = &#39;结束日期必须晚于开始日期&#39;;&#10;  }&#10;  return errors;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validateForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">values</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> errors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Partial</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">keyof</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormValues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (values.endDate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> values.startDate) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    errors.endDate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '结束日期必须晚于开始日期'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errors;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模式三-依赖字段的-watch\">模式三：依赖字段的 Watch</h3><p>React Hook Form 的 <code>useWatch</code> 允许一个字段的校验器读取另一个字段的当前值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const password = useWatch({ name: &#39;password&#39;, control });&#10;&#10;// confirmPassword 的校验规则引用 password&#10;const rules = {&#10;  validate: (value: string) =&gt; value === password || &#39;两次密码不一致&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> password</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useWatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'password'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, control });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// confirmPassword 的校验规则引用 password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> rules</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> password </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '两次密码不一致'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"错误消息的分类与层级\">错误消息的分类与层级</h2><p>错误不是一个字符串——它有类型、严重程度和来源：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FieldError {&#10;  type: &#39;required&#39; | &#39;format&#39; | &#39;range&#39; | &#39;unique&#39; | &#39;server&#39; | &#39;custom&#39;;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  severity: &#39;error&#39; | &#39;warning&#39;;&#10;  source: &#39;client&#39; | &#39;server&#39;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FieldError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'required'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'format'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'range'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unique'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'server'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'custom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  severity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warning'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  source</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'client'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重程度</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>error</code></td>\n<td>阻断提交</td>\n<td>&quot;邮箱格式无效&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warning</code></td>\n<td>不阻断提交但提示</td>\n<td>&quot;密码强度较弱，建议加入特殊字符&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>将 warning 与 error 在 UI 上做视觉区分（颜色、图标），并确保 <code>aria-invalid</code> 仅在 error 时为 <code>true</code>。<a href=\"../ux-accessibility/form-accessibility-aria\">表单无障碍与 ARIA</a> 详细讨论了错误状态与辅助技术的关联方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"服务端错误的回映射\">服务端错误的回映射</h2><p>客户端校验永远不能替代服务端校验（安全边界在服务端），但服务端返回的错误需要映射回前端字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ServerValidationResponse {&#10;  success: false;&#10;  errors: Array&lt;{&#10;    field: string;&#10;    code: string;&#10;    message: string;&#10;  }&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function mapServerErrors(&#10;  response: ServerValidationResponse,&#10;  setError: (field: string, error: { type: string; message: string }) =&gt; void,&#10;) {&#10;  for (const err of response.errors) {&#10;    setError(err.field, { type: &#39;server&#39;, message: err.message });&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerValidationResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  success</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  errors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    field</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> mapServerErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerValidationResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setError</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">field</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> err</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.errors) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    setError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(err.field, { type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'server'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, message: err.message });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>服务端错误的一个特殊要求是<strong>持久性</strong>：它们不应在用户下次修改该字段时被立即清除（因为修改后的值可能仍然不合法），而应在下次成功提交或显式的客户端重校验通过后才消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"错误呈现的-ux-模式\">错误呈现的 UX 模式</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[错误发生] --&gt; B{呈现位置}&#10;    B --&gt; C[Inline: 字段正下方]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Summary: 表单顶部汇总]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Toast: 全局通知]&#10;    C --&gt; F[适合:逐字段修正]&#10;    D --&gt; G[适合:提交后一次性定位]&#10;    E --&gt; H[适合:网络/权限等系统级错误]\">graph LR\n    A[错误发生] --&gt; B{呈现位置}\n    B --&gt; C[Inline: 字段正下方]\n    B --&gt; D[Summary: 表单顶部汇总]\n    B --&gt; E[Toast: 全局通知]\n    C --&gt; F[适合:逐字段修正]\n    D --&gt; G[适合:提交后一次性定位]\n    E --&gt; H[适合:网络/权限等系统级错误]</pre><p>最有效的模式是 <strong>Inline + Summary 组合</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>每个字段下方显示该字段的具体错误（Inline）</li>\n<li>表单顶部显示错误汇总列表，每条可点击跳转到对应字段（Summary）</li>\n<li>提交失败时焦点自动移到 Summary 区域或第一个错误字段</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这个组合满足两种修正策略：逐个修正（看 Inline）和全局定位（看 Summary）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校验规则的组织架构\">校验规则的组织架构</h2><p>随着表单增长，校验规则应从组件中抽离，形成独立的校验层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"src/&#10;  forms/&#10;    login/&#10;      schema.ts          ← Zod schema（单一真相源）&#10;      login-form.tsx     ← 组件（消费 schema）&#10;    registration/&#10;      schema.ts&#10;      registration-form.tsx&#10;  lib/&#10;    validators/&#10;      common.ts          ← 可复用校验器（手机号、身份证等）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>src/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  forms/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    login/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      schema.ts          ← Zod schema（单一真相源）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      login-form.tsx     ← 组件（消费 schema）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    registration/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      schema.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      registration-form.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  lib/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    validators/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      common.ts          ← 可复用校验器（手机号、身份证等）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种分离带来三个好处：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>校验逻辑可独立单测</li>\n<li>同一 schema 可在客户端和服务端共享（<a href=\"../libraries/zod-schema-validation\">Zod 模式校验集成</a> 深入讨论这一模式）</li>\n<li>校验规则变更不触发组件重新测试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式校验增强\">渐进式校验增强</h2><p>对于 Server-First 架构（Next.js Server Actions、Remix），校验应设计为<strong>渐进式增强</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>基线</strong>（无 JS）：HTML5 原生校验（<code>required</code>、<code>type=&quot;email&quot;</code>、<code>minlength</code>）</li>\n<li><strong>增强层</strong>（JS 加载后）：客户端 schema 校验取代原生校验</li>\n<li><strong>最终层</strong>：服务端 schema 校验（永远运行，不可绕过）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 服务端 action&#10;async function submitForm(prevState: unknown, formData: FormData) {&#10;  const result = schema.safeParse(Object.fromEntries(formData));&#10;  if (!result.success) {&#10;    return { errors: result.error.flatten().fieldErrors };&#10;  }&#10;  await saveToDatabase(result.data);&#10;  return { success: true };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 服务端 action</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> submitForm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prevState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">formData</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FormData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> schema.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">safeParse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Object.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fromEntries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(formData));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result.success) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { errors: result.error.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">flatten</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().fieldErrors };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> saveToDatabase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { success: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种分层确保即使 JavaScript 加载失败，表单仍然具备基本的校验能力。<a href=\"form-state-management\">表单状态管理模式</a> 中讨论的非受控模式（策略四）天然适配这种渐进增强——因为非受控组件本身就依赖 DOM 原生行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>校验时机是一条从 <code>onSubmit</code> 到 <code>onChange</code> 的频谱，最佳实践是组合使用（如 <code>mode: &#39;onTouched&#39;</code>），而非单选一个时机。</li>\n<li>同步校验覆盖格式与必填，异步校验（如用户名唯一性）需要处理 debounce、取消与竞态，避免旧响应覆盖新结果。</li>\n<li>跨字段校验与聚合约束应下沉到 schema 的 <code>.refine()</code> / <code>.superRefine()</code>，并用 <code>path</code> 把错误定位到具体字段。</li>\n<li>服务端错误必须回映射到对应字段，错误呈现推荐 Inline + Summary 组合，兼顾逐个修正与全局定位。</li>\n<li>校验规则应抽离为独立的 schema 层，实现客户端/服务端共享与独立单测；服务端校验是不可绕过的最终层。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"校验策略与错误处理","id":"校验策略与错误处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"校验时机的频谱","id":"校验时机的频谱"},{"level":2,"text":"同步校验与异步校验","id":"同步校验与异步校验"},{"level":3,"text":"同步校验","id":"同步校验"},{"level":3,"text":"异步校验","id":"异步校验"},{"level":2,"text":"跨字段校验","id":"跨字段校验"},{"level":3,"text":"模式一：Refinement（Zod / Yup）","id":"模式一-refinement-zod-yup"},{"level":3,"text":"模式二：Form-level Validator","id":"模式二-form-level-validator"},{"level":3,"text":"模式三：依赖字段的 Watch","id":"模式三-依赖字段的-watch"},{"level":2,"text":"错误消息的分类与层级","id":"错误消息的分类与层级"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端错误的回映射","id":"服务端错误的回映射"},{"level":2,"text":"错误呈现的 UX 模式","id":"错误呈现的-ux-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"校验规则的组织架构","id":"校验规则的组织架构"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式校验增强","id":"渐进式校验增强"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表单状态管理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/form-state-management"},"next":{"title":"受控与非受控组件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-form-engineering/fundamentals/controlled-uncontrolled"}}